---

<footer class="bg-charcoal text-white py-12 md:py-16">
  <div class="container-narrow mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
      <!-- Logo & Description -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block mb-4">
          <span class="text-2xl font-logo">
            <span class="text-amber">paliva</span><span class="text-white">hutyra</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-white/70 mb-4 max-w-md">
          Jsme rodinná firma z Frýdku-Místku specializující se na prodej kvalitních paliv.
          Osobní přístup a spolehlivost jsou naše přednosti.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <img src="/images/biomac.jpg" alt="Biomac partner" class="h-10 object-contain bg-white rounded p-1" />
          <img src="/images/znamka.jpg" alt="SD Bílínské uhlí" class="h-10 object-contain bg-white rounded p-1" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-semibold mb-4 text-amber">Rychlé odkazy</h4>
        <nav class="space-y-2">
          <a href="/" class="block text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Úvod</a>
          <a href="/cenik" class="block text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Ceník</a>
          <a href="/drevo" class="block text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Dřevo</a>
          <a href="/uhli" class="block text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Uhlí</a>
          <a href="/brikety" class="block text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Brikety</a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-semibold mb-4 text-amber">Kontakt</h4>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-white/70">
          <a href="tel:+420733708172" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
            </svg>
            733 708 172
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:info@palivahutyra.cz" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            info@palivahutyra.cz
          </a>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
            </svg>
            <span>
              J. Švermy 486<br />
              738 01 Frýdek-Místek
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8 text-center text-white/50 text-sm">
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Paliva Hutyra s.r.o. Všechna práva vyhrazena.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- SEO Text -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/5 text-center text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <p>
        Prodej a rozvoz tuhých paliv – palivové dřevo, uhlí, brikety, pelety.
        Dovážíme do měst a obcí: Frýdek-Místek, Ostrava, Paskov, Baška, Staříč, Fryčovice,
        Brušperk, Hukvaldy, Palkovice, Místek, Sviadnov, Žabeň, Staré Město, Lískovec,
        Chlebovice, Skalice, Zelinkovice, Lysůvky a okolí.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
